@startuml EUDI_Presentation_Swimlanes

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam swimlaneWidth 400
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #B8D4E0
skinparam activityBorderColor #2C5F77

title OpenID4VP Credential Presentation Flow

|Wallet (User Device)|
start
:Scan QR code\nopenid4vp:// URI;
note right
  **Privacy control point**
  User initiated action
  No passive disclosure
end note

:Parse presentation request;
:Download presentation_definition\nfrom request_uri;

:Match credentials using JSONPath\n""$.type"" contains ""VerifiableId"";
note right
  **Privacy control point**
  Only matching credentials shown
  User sees what will be shared
end note

:User selects credential\nand approves disclosure;

:Filter SD-JWT disclosures\nto minimum required fields;
note right
  **Privacy control point**
  Selective disclosure
  Only requested attributes
end note

:Calculate sd_hash\nfrom selected disclosures;

:Create key-binding JWT\nwith sd_hash, nonce, aud;
note right
  **Security checkpoint**
  Cryptographic binding
  Prevents replay attacks
end note

:Build vp_token with\nSD-JWT + filtered disclosures + KB-JWT;

:Create presentation_submission\nwith descriptor_map;

|Verifier (Relying Party)|
:Receive POST to response_uri\nwith vp_token and submission;

:Validate key-binding JWT\nsignature and claims;
note left
  **Security checkpoint**
  Verify wallet key ownership
  Check nonce freshness
end note

:Extract SD-JWT and disclosures\nfrom vp_token;

:Verify SD-JWT issuer signature;
note left
  **Security checkpoint**
  Trust chain validation
  Issuer authenticity
end note

:Validate sd_hash matches\nincluded disclosures;
note left
  **Security checkpoint**
  Integrity verification
  Tamper detection
end note

:Check credential expiration\nand revocation status;

:Extract claims from\nselected disclosures;

:Return success response\nwith redirect_uri;

|Wallet (User Device)|
:Display verification result;
note right
  **Total time: ~1-2 seconds**

  **Privacy guarantees**
  - Selective disclosure (user control)
  - No issuer notification
  - No correlation between verifiers
  - Minimal data transfer

  **Security guarantees**
  - Cryptographic key binding
  - Replay attack prevention
  - Tamper detection
  - Issuer signature validation
end note
stop

@enduml
